<title>MOROCCO: Morocco issues local council elections results.</title>
<headline>Morocco issues local council elections results.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's interior ministry on Friday issued final results of local council elections held on June 13.</p>
<p>It gave the results of 24,239 constituencies out of a total 24,253. The remaining 14 constituencies were annulled, the ministry said.</p>
